{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link href=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/web_font/nexon_gothic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">@font-face {\r\n            font-family: 'Cafe24Danjunghae';\r\n            src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_twelve@1.1/Cafe24Danjunghae.woff') format('woff');\r\n            font-weight: normal;\r\n            font-style: normal;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 기본 */\r\n        .font_NMr {\r\n            font-family: 'NanumMyeongjo' !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .font_NMb {\r\n            font-family: 'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .font_NMeb {\r\n            font-family: 'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .font_NGL {\r\n            font-family: 'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light' !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .font_NGB {\r\n            font-family: 'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Bold' !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap * {\r\n            box-sizing: border-box;\r\n            word-break: keep-all;\r\n            word-wrap: break-word;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap ul,\r\n        ol,\r\n        li,\r\n        dl,\r\n        dt,\r\n        dd,\r\n        p,\r\n        div,\r\n        span,\r\n        section,\r\n        i,\r\n        form,\r\n        fieldset,\r\n        input,\r\n        table,\r\n        tr,\r\n        th,\r\n        td,\r\n        button,\r\n        textarea,\r\n        br {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap i {\r\n            font-style: normal;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap ul,\r\n        ol,\r\n        li,\r\n        dl,\r\n        dt,\r\n        dd {\r\n            list-style: none;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap img {\r\n            width: auto;\r\n            max-width: 100%;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n            font-family: 'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            max-width: 1200px !important;\r\n            font-weight: 400;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            font-size: 12px;\r\n            letter-spacing: -0.05em;\r\n            -webkit-letter-spacing: -0.25px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            color: #1b1b1b;\r\n            line-height: 1.4;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* FONT SIZE CSS */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap p {\r\n            transform: rotate(0.04deg);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*18px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {\r\n            font-size: 1.6667em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*20px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {\r\n            font-size: 2em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*24px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {\r\n            font-size: 2.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*30px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {\r\n            font-size: 3em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*36px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {\r\n            font-size: 3.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*42px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {\r\n            font-size: 4em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*48px*/\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .p7 {\r\n            font-size: 6em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /*72px*/\r\n\r\n        /* FONT STYLE CSS */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .fw_600 {\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .lh_10 {\r\n            line-height: 1;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .lh_12 {\r\n            line-height: 1.2;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .ta_l {\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .ta_r {\r\n            text-align: right;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* FONT COLOR CSS */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .color_white {\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .color_gray {\r\n            color: #a0a0a0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .color_yellow {\r\n            color: #fdd000;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .color_purple {\r\n            color: #422d8d\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* BG COLOR CSS */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .bg_whitegray {\r\n            background-color: #fafafa;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .bg_gray {\r\n            background-color: #bfbfbf;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .bg_black {\r\n            background-color: #000;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .bg_purple {\r\n            background-color: #422d8d;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* MARGIN CSS */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_04em {\r\n            margin-top: 0.4em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_05em {\r\n            margin-top: 0.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt-1em {\r\n            margin-top: -1em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_15em {\r\n            margin-top: 1.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {\r\n            margin-top: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {\r\n            margin-top: 30px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {\r\n            margin-top: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {\r\n            margin-top: 50px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {\r\n            margin-top: 70px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_90 {\r\n            margin-top: 90px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {\r\n            margin-top: 100px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {\r\n            margin-top: 150px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* PADDING CSS */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pt_3em {\r\n            padding-top: 3em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {\r\n            padding-top: 80px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pb_3em {\r\n            padding-bottom: 3em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {\r\n            padding-bottom: 80px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pl_40 {\r\n            padding-left: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pd_5p {\r\n            padding: 5%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pd_1em {\r\n            padding: 1em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pd_2em {\r\n            padding: 2em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .grid_3step {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 30%);\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            row-gap: 4em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .grid_4step {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 23.8%);\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            row-gap: 4em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .grid_textList {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 2.4167em auto;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            align-items: start;\r\n            gap: 1.25em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            flex-direction: column;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c_auto {\r\n            flex: auto;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .w70 {\r\n            width: 70%;\r\n            margin-left: 15%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .w80 {\r\n            width: 80%;\r\n            margin-left: 10%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .w90 {\r\n            width: 90%;\r\n            margin-left: 5%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .pos_r {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .wMax {\r\n            width: max-content;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10 {\r\n            border-radius: 10px;\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {\r\n            border-radius: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {\r\n            display: none;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {\r\n            display: block;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 타이틀 */\r\n        .PointNum {\r\n            font-family: Cafe24Danjunghae;\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n            border: #1b1b1b 1px solid;\r\n            border-radius: 50px;\r\n            line-height: 1;\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 0.6em 1.5em 0.4em;\r\n            letter-spacing: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 키이미지 */\r\n        .KeyImg .key_TextBox {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 8%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .KeyImg .key_TextBox .gc_elixir_logo {\r\n            width: 18.75vw;\r\n            max-width: 225px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .KeyImg .key_TextBox .theelixir_purple {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            width: 14.6667vw;\r\n            max-width: 176px;\r\n            top: 31%;\r\n            right: 0;\r\n            transform: translateX(51%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 디엘릭서 퍼플로 */\r\n        .From_Purple {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 9%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 디엘릭서 퍼플의 특별함 */\r\n        .Special_Point {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 43% 1fr;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            column-gap: 5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Special_Point img {\r\n            margin-top: 2.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Special_Point .flex_box li {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            padding: 1.2em 0;\r\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #e8e8e8;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Special_Point .flex_box li:last-of-type {\r\n            border-bottom: none;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Special_Point .flex_box li p:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            margin-left: 0.8em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 전세계가 주목하는 슈퍼푸드 */\r\n        .Super_Food {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 10%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 호장근속 레스베라트롤 */\r\n        .Resveratrol {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 0%;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            transform: translateX(-50%);\r\n            padding: 5em 6em;\r\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\r\n            border-radius: 0 0 1.5em 1.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 01 : 강력한 항산화 원료, 레스베라트롤! */\r\n        .Red_Wine .text_box {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 50%;\r\n            left: 8%;\r\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Red_Wine img {\r\n            margin: 0 !important;\r\n            width: 50% !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 02 : 인체 흡수력이 높은 순도 100% 트랜스형 레스베라트롤 */\r\n        .Resveratrol_Kind {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            gap: 6.25%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Resveratrol_Kind div:nth-of-type(1) {\r\n            border: 0.25em solid #bfbfbf;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(#fff 90%, #bfbfbf 90%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Resveratrol_Kind div:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            border: 0.25em solid #422d8d;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(#fff 90%, #422d8d 90%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 03 : 호장근, 포도씨, 석류의 완벽 배합 */\r\n        .Perfect_Combination li {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: start;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            padding: 1.5em;\r\n            border: 0.1667em solid #dcd8e9;\r\n            border-radius: 200px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Perfect_Combination li img {\r\n            width: 15vw;\r\n            max-width: 180px;\r\n            border-radius: 100%;\r\n            margin: 0 !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Perfect_Combination li div {\r\n            margin-left: 4em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Perfect_Combination .plusmark {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            padding: 0.25em 0.4em 0.17em;\r\n            border-radius: 100%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Perfect_Combination .plusmark:nth-of-type(1) {\r\n            top: 33%;\r\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Perfect_Combination .plusmark:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            bottom: 33%;\r\n            transform: translateY(50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 이런분들에게 권장드립니다 */\r\n        .Recommended_Target {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 46% 1fr;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            column-gap: 4em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 제품 사용 방법 */\r\n        .StepNum {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 0%;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            width: 50%;\r\n            height: 8em;\r\n            padding-top: 1.8em;\r\n            transform: translate(-50%, -48%) !important;\r\n            border-radius: 100%;\r\n            z-index: -1;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n        .Brand_Grid {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 56%;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: start;\r\n            border: #ccc solid 1px;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .Brand_Grid .logo_img {\r\n            max-width: 40% !important;\r\n            margin-top: 1em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {\r\n                margin-top: 0.8333vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {\r\n                margin-top: 1.6667vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {\r\n                margin-top: 2.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {\r\n                margin-top: 3.3333vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {\r\n                margin-top: 4.1667vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {\r\n                margin-top: 5.8333vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_90 {\r\n                margin-top: 7.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {\r\n                margin-top: 8.3333vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {\r\n                margin-top: 12.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {\r\n                padding-top: 6.6667vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {\r\n                padding-bottom: 6.6667vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pl_40 {\r\n                padding-left: 3.3333vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10,\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {\r\n                border-radius: 0.8333vw;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:1020px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 10px;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {\r\n                font-size: 1.8em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*18px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {\r\n                font-size: 2em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*20px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {\r\n                font-size: 2.4em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*24px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {\r\n                font-size: 3em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*30px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {\r\n                font-size: 3.6em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*36px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {\r\n                font-size: 4.2em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*42px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {\r\n                font-size: 4.8em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*48px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p7 {\r\n                font-size: 7.2em;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            /*72px*/\r\n            .grid_textList img {\r\n                margin-top: 0.2em;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:920px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 9px;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w70,\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w80 {\r\n                width: 90%;\r\n                margin-left: 5%;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {\r\n                display: block;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {\r\n                display: none;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:820px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 8px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 7px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:620px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 6px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n            .Brand_Grid {\r\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n                row-gap: 4.1667vw;\r\n                text-align: center;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .Brand_Grid .logo_img {\r\n                margin-top: 0 !important;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:520px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 5px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:420px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 4px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:320px) {\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {\r\n                font-size: 3px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_DetailWrap\">\n<section class=\"KeyImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"key_TextBox w90 pl_40 ta_l color_white\"><img class=\"gc_elixir_logo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/gcoop_the_elixir_logo_white.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p3 font_NGL mt_90\">라이프 스타일에 따라 달라지는<br/>\r\n나만의 묘약 레시피</p>\n<p class=\"p7 wMax pos_r mt_20\"><span class=\"font_NGL\">지쿱 디엘릭서</span> <span class=\"fw_600\">퍼플</span><img class=\"theelixir_purple\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple.png\"/></p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_30\">강력한 보랏빛 에너지의 힘,<br/>\r\nWell-Aging(웰에이징)을 위한 시작!</p>\n<p class=\"p2 font_NGL mt_10\">매일이 즐겁고 <span class=\"fw_600 color_yellow\">건강한 아름다움</span>으로<br/>\r\n채워지도록 디엘릭서가 함께 합니다.</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_keyimg.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"pos_r\">\n<div class=\"From_Purple w90\">\n<p class=\"p5 fw_600\"><span class=\"color_purple\">디엘릭서 퍼플</span>로</p>\n<p class=\"p4\">몸 속부터 강력하게 채워지는<br/>\r\n레스베라트롤의 효과를 경험하세요!</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">고함량의 글로벌 트렌드 원료를 한 포로 간편하게!</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_01.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w80 mt_150\">\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB\">디엘릭서 <span class=\"color_purple\">퍼플</span>의 특별함</p>\n<div class=\"Special_Point ta_l mt_50\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_02.jpg\"/>\n<ul class=\"flex_box\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMb color_yellow\">01</p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"fw_600 color_purple\">트랜스형 레스베라트롤</span> 함유</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMb color_yellow\">02</p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"fw_600 color_purple\">호장근, 포도씨, 석류</span>의 완벽한 배합</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMb color_yellow\">03</p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"fw_600 color_purple\">액상 스틱 타입으로</span> 언제 어디서든 간편하게!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMb color_yellow\">04</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">독자적으로 배합한 <span class=\"fw_600 color_purple\">엄선한 부원료</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_150 pos_r\">\n<div class=\"Super_Food w90\">\n<p class=\"p4 font_NGB color_purple\">전세계가 주목하는 슈퍼푸드!<br/>\r\n관련 논문만 약 40만 여편</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_05em\">레스베라트롤 관련 연간 <span class=\"fw_600\">약 1,000 편의 연구결과</span>가 발표되고 있습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_03.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<div class=\"w90\">\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt-1em\">레스베라트롤 이란?</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span class=\"fw_600\">항산화물질인 폴리페놀 계열</span>에 속하며,<br/>\r\n영국 과학전문지 ‘네이처’에 발표된 연구보고서에 따르면<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">단세포 생물인 효모의 수명을 80 % 연장시키는 것</span>을 확인했다고 합니다.</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"w80 mt_100 pos_r\">\n<div class=\"Resveratrol wMax\">\n<p class=\"p4 font_NGB\">‘호장근’ 속 레스베라트롤?</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_05em\">주로 산지에서 자라며 어릴 때 줄기의 생김새가<br/>\r\n호피를 닮았다고 해서 호장근 이라고 불리웁니다.<br/>\r\n뿌리줄기는 약재로 이용되고 어린 줄기는 식용으로 이용됩니다.<br/>\r\n일반적으로 포도추출물에 비해 레스베라트롤 함량이 높으며<br/>\r\n트랜스형 레스베라트롤 성분 입니다.</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_04.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w90 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"PointNum p2\">Point 01</div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt_30\">10대 슈퍼푸드 레드와인 속<br/>\r\n레스베라트롤!</p>\n<div class=\"Red_Wine bg_black bdr_10 ta_r pos_r mt_50\">\n<div class=\"text_box ta_l\">\n<p class=\"p1 color_white mt_20\">식물 72여 종에 함유되어 있다고 알려진 레스베라트롤은<br/>\r\n해당 식물에 처음부터 들어있는 성분은 아닙니다.<br/>\r\n작물이 생육하며 곰팡이와 해충, 박테리아와 끊임 없이 싸워서<br/>\r\n스스로 보호하려고 껍질을 두껍게 만드는데<br/>\r\n이때 화학반응이 일어나며 레스베라트롤을 비롯한<br/>\r\n폴리페놀이 분비되는 것입니다.</p>\n<p class=\"p0 color_gray mt_50\">* 위 정보는 제품이 아닌 원료에 대한 정보입니다.</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_05.jpg\"/></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"w80 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"PointNum p2\">Point 02</div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt_30\">인체 흡수력이 높은<br/>\r\n순도 100% 트랜스형 레스베라트롤</p>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_purple mt_70\">레스베라트롤의 종류</p>\n<div class=\"Resveratrol_Kind mt_30\">\n<div class=\"bdr_10 flex_c\">\n<p class=\"p2 mt_40 color_gray\">시스 레스베라트롤<br/>\r\n(Cis-Resveratrol)</p>\n<img class=\"mt_30\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_06_1.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"flex_c_auto p2 color_white bg_gray mt_40 pd_1em\">불안정한 분자구조</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bdr_10 flex_c\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 mt_40 color_purple\">트랜스 레스베라트롤<br/>\r\n(Trans-Resveratrol)</p>\n<img class=\"mt_30\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_06_2.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"flex_c_auto p2 color_white bg_purple mt_40 pd_1em\">높은 안정성 &amp; 흡수력</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt_30 bg_whitegray pd_5p bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p2\">레스베라트롤은 시스형과 트랜스형으로 분류되는데<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">트랜스형이 시스보다 유익한 효능을 가진 활성성분으로 알려져 있으며<br/>\r\n순도가 높은 형태</span></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"w70 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"PointNum p2\">Point 03</div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt_30\">호장근, 포도씨, 석류의 완벽 배합</p>\n<div class=\"Perfect_Combination mt_70 pos_r\">\n<ul class=\"ta_l\">\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_07_1.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_purple\">호장근추출물</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_05em\">포도추출물에 비해 다량의 레스베라트롤 함유 항염,<br/>\r\n\t항산화 효과가 뛰어나 주로 약재로 사용</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"mt_20\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_07_2.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_purple\">포도씨추출물</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_05em\">포도 과육에 비해 플라보노이드 함량이 많은 것으로 알려짐</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">레스베라트롤이 함유되어 있으며 폴리페놀류가 다량 함유</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">피부미백 및 탄력에도 도움을 주는 것으로 알려짐</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"mt_20\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_07_3.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_purple\">석류</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_05em\">레스베라트롤이 다량 함유되어 있는 과실류</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">에스트로겐과 유사한 성분인 엘라그산이라는 항산화 물질도 함유됨</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"plusmark p4 font_NGB lh_10 color_white bg_purple\">+</p>\n<p class=\"plusmark p4 font_NGB lh_10 color_white bg_purple\">+</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"w70 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"PointNum p2\">Point 04</div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt_30\">액상스틱 타입으로 간편하게!</p>\n<img class=\"mt_70 w90\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_08.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w70 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"PointNum p2\">Point 05</div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt_30\">엄선한 부원료 사용</p>\n<ul class=\"grid_3step mt_70\">\n<li class=\"flex_c bg_whitegray\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_09_1.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 flex_c_auto pd_5p\">회화나무추출물</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex_c bg_whitegray\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_09_2.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 flex_c_auto pd_5p\">블루베리</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex_c bg_whitegray\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_09_3.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 flex_c_auto pd_5p\">세븐베리</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex_c bg_whitegray\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_09_4.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 flex_c_auto pd_5p\">마카</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex_c bg_whitegray\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_09_5.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 flex_c_auto pd_5p\">아르기닌</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex_c bg_whitegray\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the_elixir_purple_img_09_6.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 flex_c_auto pd_5p\">비타민C(영국산)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_150 bg_whitegray pt_80 pb_80\">\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB\">이런분들에게 권장드립니다!</p>\n<div class=\"w70 Recommended_Target mt_50\"><img class=\"mt_15em\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_purple/the